---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<style is:global>
  .demo-page { --demo-ink:#142019; --demo-green:#1d4935; --demo-lime:#c9e56b; --demo-copper:#d78355; --demo-paper:#f4f1e8; --demo-muted:#aebbb1; background:var(--demo-paper); color:#172019; }
  .demo-hero { padding:34px 0 66px; background:radial-gradient(circle at 82% 12%,#315a3f 0,transparent 33%),var(--demo-ink); color:#f7f5eb; }
  .demo-shell { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 44px)); margin:0 auto; }
  .demo-nav { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:20px; padding-bottom:20px; border-bottom:1px solid #385244; }
  .demo-nav strong { font-size:17px; letter-spacing:-.04em; }.demo-nav small,.demo-kicker { color:var(--demo-lime); font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.14em; }
  .demo-hero-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr; gap:54px; align-items:end; padding-top:72px; }
  .demo-hero h1 { max-width:700px; margin:16px 0 20px; color:#f7f5eb; font-size:clamp(50px,7vw,88px); line-height:.94; letter-spacing:-.08em; }.demo-hero h1 em { color:var(--demo-copper); font-style:normal; }
  .demo-lead { max-width:620px; color:#d0d9d0; font-size:19px; line-height:1.55; }
  .demo-disclaimer { margin-top:25px; padding:13px 15px; border-left:3px solid var(--demo-copper); background:#26372d; color:#d8e2d9; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; }
  .demo-terminal { padding:22px; border:1px solid #59715f; background:#102219; box-shadow:0 20px 55px #08110b88; }.demo-terminal-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; color:var(--demo-muted); font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace; }.demo-terminal-live { color:var(--demo-lime); }.demo-terminal h2 { margin:28px 0 8px; color:#f7f5eb; font-size:26px; letter-spacing:-.05em; }.demo-terminal p { margin:0; color:#aebbb1; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; }
  .demo-button { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; margin-top:26px; padding:13px 16px; border:1px solid var(--demo-lime); background:var(--demo-lime); color:var(--demo-ink); font:700 11px 'DM Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.05em; text-decoration:none; text-transform:uppercase; }.demo-button.secondary { border-color:#536c59; background:transparent; color:#f7f5eb; }
  .demo-section { padding:70px 0; }.demo-section.alt { background:#e6e4dc; }.demo-section h2 { margin:10px 0 14px; font-size:clamp(35px,5vw,62px); line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.07em; }.demo-intro { max-width:650px; color:#53605a; font-size:18px; line-height:1.55; }
  .demo-stats { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:10px; margin-top:32px; }.demo-stat { min-height:138px; padding:20px; border-top:4px solid var(--demo-copper); background:#fffdf7; }.demo-stat b { display:block; color:var(--demo-green); font-size:39px; letter-spacing:-.08em; }.demo-stat span { display:block; margin-top:8px; color:#53605a; font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace; line-height:1.4; text-transform:uppercase; }.demo-stat small { display:block; margin-top:12px; color:#7b807b; font-size:11px; }
  .demo-console { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr; gap:16px; margin-top:20px; }.demo-panel { padding:25px; border:1px solid #d1d0c7; background:#fffdf7; }.demo-panel h3 { margin:8px 0 20px; color:var(--demo-green); font-size:25px; letter-spacing:-.05em; }.demo-panel p { color:#53605a; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; }.demo-activity { display:grid; grid-template-columns:30px 1fr auto; gap:12px; align-items:center; padding:15px 0; border-top:1px solid #e0ded5; }.demo-activity i { display:grid; place-items:center; width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:50%; background:#e6efd0; color:var(--demo-green); font-style:normal; }.demo-activity strong,.demo-activity small { display:block; }.demo-activity small { margin-top:4px; color:#7b807b; font-size:11px; }.demo-activity time { color:#7b807b; font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace; }
  .demo-revenue { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; margin-top:18px; }.demo-revenue-card { padding:16px; background:#edf0df; }.demo-revenue-card strong { display:block; color:var(--demo-green); font-size:25px; }.demo-revenue-card span { display:block; margin-top:6px; color:#68716a; font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace; line-height:1.4; }
  .demo-bottom { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; align-items:center; margin-top:28px; padding:24px; background:var(--demo-ink); color:#f7f5eb; }.demo-bottom h3 { margin:0 0 8px; color:#f7f5eb; font-size:25px; letter-spacing:-.05em; }.demo-bottom p { max-width:650px; margin:0; color:#b9c6ba; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; }.demo-bottom .demo-button { white-space:nowrap; }
  @media (max-width:850px) { .demo-hero-grid,.demo-console { grid-template-columns:1fr; }.demo-stats { grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); } }
  @media (max-width:600px) { .demo-shell { width:min(100% - 36px,1160px); }.demo-hero-grid { padding-top:52px; }.demo-stats { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }.demo-bottom { display:block; }.demo-bottom .demo-button { width:100%; }.demo-nav small { display:none; } }
</style>
<Layout title="Connected Course Demo — StickLink Golf" description="A clearly labeled State of Stick Golf demonstration showing the operator and golfer experience together." eyebrow="STATE OF STICK GOLF / DEMO">
  <div class="demo-page">
    <section class="demo-hero"><div class="demo-shell"><nav class="demo-nav"><strong>STATE OF STICK / GOLF</strong><small>CONNECTED COURSE · DEMO ENVIRONMENT</small></nav><div class="demo-hero-grid"><div><div class="demo-kicker">THE OPERATOR DEMO</div><h1>See the course<br /><em>come alive.</em></h1><p class="demo-lead">One operating layer connects the golfer, the course, the clubhouse, the league, and the next visit through one familiar action: tap.</p><div class="demo-disclaimer"><strong>DEMONSTRATION DATA</strong><br />This is a product demonstration using simulated course activity. No course partnership, adoption, order volume, or revenue shown here is represented as real.</div></div><div class="demo-terminal"><div class="demo-terminal-head"><span>CONNECTED COURSE / TEST PROPERTY</span><span class="demo-terminal-live">● DEMO LIVE</span></div><h2>Cedar Ridge Golf Club</h2><p>Maple City, Michigan · simulated operator view</p><a class="demo-button" href="/demo/golfer/">Experience as a golfer ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="demo-section"><div class="demo-shell"><div class="demo-kicker" style="color:var(--demo-copper)">A COURSE-SIZED OPPORTUNITY</div><h2>Turn scattered moments<br />into a connected day.</h2><p class="demo-intro">The operator sees what is happening across the property: who is engaging, what needs attention, which services are being requested, and what can bring golfers back.</p><div class="demo-stats"><article class="demo-stat"><b>127</b><span>Golfer check-ins</span><small>Simulated today</small></article><article class="demo-stat"><b>438</b><span>StickLink taps</span><small>Simulated today</small></article><article class="demo-stat"><b>31</b><span>Service requests</span><small>Simulated today</small></article><article class="demo-stat"><b>$487</b><span>Tap-attributed value</span><small>Illustrative, not settled revenue</small></article><article class="demo-stat"><b>4</b><span>Active matches</span><small>Simulated league activity</small></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="demo-section alt"><div class="demo-shell"><div class="demo-kicker" style="color:var(--demo-copper)">OPERATOR CONTROL CENTER</div><div class="demo-console"><article class="demo-panel"><h3>What needs attention?</h3><div class="demo-activity"><i>!</i><div><strong>Halfway House order</strong><small>2 items · Cart delivery · Hole 09</small></div><time>2m</time></div><div class="demo-activity"><i>?</i><div><strong>Golf Agent question trend</strong><small>6 golfers asked about the local rule on Hole 08</small></div><time>Today</time></div><div class="demo-activity"><i>◎</i><div><strong>Cart 031</strong><small>Service request · operator review needed</small></div><time>8m</time></div><div class="demo-activity"><i>↗</i><div><strong>Thursday Open</strong><small>4 cross-course matches in progress</small></div><time>Live</time></div></article><article class="demo-panel"><div class="demo-kicker" style="color:var(--demo-copper)">VALUE TRACKING</div><h3>Follow the interaction.</h3><p>Every number is attached to an interaction, a service request, or an event record. In a real deployment, payment settlement and POS truth remain separate integrations.</p><div class="demo-revenue"><div class="demo-revenue-card"><strong>18</strong><span>Illustrative orders<br />from halfway house</span></div><div class="demo-revenue-card"><strong>21%</strong><span>Illustrative sponsor<br />tap-to-claim rate</span></div><div class="demo-revenue-card"><strong>14</strong><span>Requests completed<br />in the demo day</span></div><div class="demo-revenue-card"><strong>3:42</strong><span>Illustrative average<br />response time</span></div></div></article></div><div class="demo-bottom"><div><h3>Now experience the other side.</h3><p>Become the golfer. Tap into the round, record a score, request food or drinks, and ask the Golf Agent from the same connected course.</p></div><a class="demo-button" href="/demo/golfer/">Start the golfer journey ↗</a></div></div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
